# recursive interpolation not allowed

Wyjście pisz: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Program funkcja: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), nowa-linia.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Wyjście pisz: a, nowa-linia.


